Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:50.01,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}苍蝇变多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:50.01,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Them flies are gettin' thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:53.47,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}应该给你好好冲一冲了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:53.47,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Somebody ought to give you a good hosin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.09,0:01:56.67,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}天气真是太热了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.09,0:01:56.67,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Heat ain't helpin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.75,0:02:00.48,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}看来你还能再活一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.75,0:02:00.48,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Eh, reckon you'll keep another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.42,0:02:05.31,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}乖一点 我中午给你带点水来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.42,0:02:05.31,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Be good, I'll bring you some more water round noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:08.59,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}再见 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:08.59,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Bye, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.81,0:02:38.42,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}拜托 别咬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.81,0:02:38.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:40.30,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}别咬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:40.30,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:04.43,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你去散步了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:04.43,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You have a good walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.21,0:03:07.38,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}去了 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.21,0:03:07.38,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yes, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:10.42,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}今早的散步非常愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:10.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Top-notch walk this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:15.17,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}给了我强健的体魄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:15.17,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Top-notch constitutional.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:22.47,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}自从我留下印记已经几个星期了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:22.47,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It's been weeks since I left my mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:25.55,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们应该已经看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:25.55,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Would that they had eyes to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:29.15,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你能不要把比莉小姐带进来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:29.15,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Don't you get Miss Billie in here with them dirty feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.02,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不好意思啊 老伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.02,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Sorry, old chap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:04:00.09,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你今天想种花吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:04:00.09,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You want to make flowers today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:03.56,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不 贝蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:03.56,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No, Betty,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:06.35,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我有很重要的事要做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:06.35,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I have very important work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:08.48,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:08.48,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}My...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:12.90,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}已接近飞升之境
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:12.90,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}ascension removes me from the disc and the loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:15.54,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就要到最后阶段了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:15.54,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm near final stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.83,0:04:17.97,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}有些早上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.83,0:04:17.97,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Some mornings,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:21.33,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我能看到飞往地狱的飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:21.33,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I can see the infernal plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:26.42,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你已经大约有三个星期没有跟我做爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:26.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You haven't made flowers on me for maybe 3 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:28.96,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}让我非常难过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:28.96,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Makes me sad is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:34.43,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}来我腿上坐着 小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:34.43,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Ah, come up in me lap, lass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.43,0:04:38.97,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这里来 让我安慰你的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.43,0:04:38.97,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Here, and let me comfort ye in your distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:42.03,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你又笑话我了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:42.03,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You're make fun of me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:44.24,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不 我为什么要这么做呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:44.24,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No, why'd I do a thing like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:47.71,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}因为你特别机灵吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:47.71,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Is it because you're ne so bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.86,0:04:50.97,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}因为你总是呆呆的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.86,0:04:50.97,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Because of your head bein' so slow and like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:55.54,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}快放我走 不然我会让你欲火焚身的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:55.54,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh, you better let me go 'cause I'm burn your eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:09.26,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}能跟我说说爷爷吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:09.26,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Couldn't you tell me about Grampa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:25.09,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我在甘蔗田里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:25.09,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I was in the cane fields,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.53,0:05:28.87,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他趁我一个人的时候抓住了我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.53,0:05:28.87,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and he caught me when I was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:32.90,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}泥土很温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:32.90,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And the dirt was warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:36.05,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我躺在温暖的泥土上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:36.05,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I felt the dirt warm on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:59.27,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}再不按我说的做你的膝盖可就保不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:59.27,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You're gonna lose a kneecap if I got to ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.27,0:06:01.57,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}把它从袋子里拿出来放进录像机里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.27,0:06:01.57,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Take it out of the bag and put it in the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:25.80,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}别看我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:25.80,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:27.72,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}看屏幕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:27.72,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Look at the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.31,0:06:48.69,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}天呐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.31,0:06:48.69,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh, Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:51.56,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你为什么给我看这个?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:51.56,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why are you showing me this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:06.13,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这就是你说去找她爸爸的那个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:06.13,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That little girl is the one you said went to see her daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:08.86,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}玛丽 方特诺特 大约在1990年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:08.86,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Marie Fontenot, circa 1990.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.63,0:07:16.09,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我上交过一份失踪青少年报告
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.63,0:07:16.09,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I took a m-missing juvenile report.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.54,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}当我事后想跟进的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.54,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And when I went back to follow up on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:24.50,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}文件上写着"报告有误"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:24.50,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}the file said, "report made in error."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:27.07,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我没这么写过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:27.07,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I never wrote that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:31.63,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我带着它去找了治安官 泰德 柴尔德里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:31.63,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}So I marched it right in to the sheriff, Ted Childress.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:33.13,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他已经去世了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:33.13,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He's dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:35.05,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是他写的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:35.05,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:37.32,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}治安官怎么说?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:37.32,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}What'd the sheriff say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:39.41,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他说是他改的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:39.41,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He said he'd changed it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:42.01,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他认识这孩子的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:42.01,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}that he knew the mother and the father,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.03,0:07:43.88,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}和叔叔婶婶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.03,0:07:43.88,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}the aunt and the uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:47.70,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这事就是侄女从他这里搬走了之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:47.70,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It was a niece once removed from him or somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:50.12,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这就是行政系统
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:50.12,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It was the chain of command.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:52.17,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没法改变
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:52.17,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No reason to change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:55.83,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我只是...照上级的要求做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:55.83,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I just... follow what the big man says.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:57.84,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:57.84,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:00.87,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:00.87,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}how this all works.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:04.30,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我试着去找孩子的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:04.30,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I...I tried to get back with the mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:05.81,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我试着去找她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:05.81,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I tried to get back with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.75,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}她不见了 她走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.75,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}She was gone! She split!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:09.66,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}文件不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:09.66,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}The file was gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:11.62,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}却没人提起
