Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.02,0:18:15.56,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Grandma, she still with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.56,0:18:16.89,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 你是问她还活着吗? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.56,0:18:16.89,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- Alive, you mean? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:19.07,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}活着呢 住在阿比维尔的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:19.07,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, she's in an old folks' place.
