Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.15,0:18:20.07,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Abbeville.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.48,0:18:25.72,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}希尔夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.48,0:18:25.72,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Mrs. Hill, now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.94,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}接下来的问题可能有点匪夷所思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.94,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}this is a very strange question,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:34.05,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但你还记得94或95年的冬天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:34.05,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but, um, do you remember back in the winter of '94 or '95,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:36.00,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你有给房子刷漆吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:36.00,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}did you get your house painted?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:40.70,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}刷了 没错 我刷了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:40.70,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I did. Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.25,0:18:42.49,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}很漂亮的绿色漆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.25,0:18:42.49,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}A nice green.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.95,0:18:45.15,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但我记不起那颜色叫什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.95,0:18:45.15,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Don't remember what they call it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:47.27,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你还记不记得
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:47.27,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Do you happen to remember
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.29,0:18:49.45,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}谁给你刷的房子?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.29,0:18:49.45,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}who it was that painted your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:50.81,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}记得
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:50.81,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:54.54,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}名字记不清了 但他们是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:54.54,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I don't remember the name, but they were nice men.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:56.35,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们在我们的教区工作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:56.35,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}They worked for our parish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:58.53,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}打理院子 粉刷房子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:58.53,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yard work, house-painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:19:00.72,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们对我们教堂有折扣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:19:00.72,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}My church, they got a discount.
