Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.05,0:19:06.79,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Do you remember, by any chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:10.23,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们的名字或是其他细节?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:10.23,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}names or just any other details?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.13,0:19:16.39,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我记得 粉刷整栋房子的外墙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.13,0:19:16.39,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I remember they charged $250
