Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.97,0:19:27.41,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}脸下面布满了伤疤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.97,0:19:27.41,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}scarring all along the bottom of his face.
