Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.52,0:49:15.87,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It was like I was a part of everything
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.87,0:49:19.16,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}合为一体了 我们全都...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.87,0:49:19.16,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}that I ever loved, and we were all...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.02,0:49:23.67,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们三个人 都在...慢慢消逝
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.02,0:49:23.67,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}the 3 of us, just... just fadin' out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.53,0:49:30.54,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}而我只要放手就行了...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.53,0:49:30.54,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And all I had to do was let go...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.61,0:49:33.61,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我也确实这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.61,0:49:33.61,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.04,0:49:38.45,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我说"黑暗"
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.04,0:49:38.45,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I said, "Darkness, yeah, yeah."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.03,0:49:42.67,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}然后我就消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.03,0:49:42.67,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And I disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.26,0:49:48.12,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但是我仍然可以 可以感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.26,0:49:48.12,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}But I could... I could still feel
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.46,0:49:50.76,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}她对我的爱意
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.46,0:49:50.76,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}her love there,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.68,0:49:54.43,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}更甚从前
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.68,0:49:54.43,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}even more than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.71,0:49:57.67,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}只有...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.71,0:49:57.67,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.87,0:50:04.71,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}只有爱意紧紧包围着我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.87,0:50:04.71,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}There was nothing but that love.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.99,0:50:19.17,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}接着我醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.99,0:50:19.17,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Then I woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.40,0:50:38.40,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}有一次吃晚饭的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.40,0:50:38.40,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Didn't you tell me one time at dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.08,0:50:41.81,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你不是告诉过我 你以前
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.08,0:50:41.81,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}once, maybe, about you used to...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.20,0:50:46.57,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你以前会编点星空的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.20,0:50:46.57,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}you used to make up stories about the stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.01,0:50:50.06,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是的 那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.01,0:50:50.06,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.48,0:50:51.38,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.48,0:50:51.38,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}that was, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.16,0:50:54.75,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我在阿拉斯加州的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.16,0:50:54.75,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}in A-Alaska,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.54,0:50:57.83,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}在浩瀚夜空之下...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.54,0:50:57.83,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}under the...under the night skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.08,0:51:00.37,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你躺在地上 抬头张望
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.08,0:51:00.37,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, you used to lay there and look up,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.26,0:51:02.96,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}遥望星空?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.26,0:51:02.96,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}yeah, at the stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.11,0:51:07.04,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是啊 但你也知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.11,0:51:07.04,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, and you remember I...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.67,0:51:10.26,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我17岁之前都没看过电视
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.67,0:51:10.26,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I never watched a TV till I was 17,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.26,0:51:12.08,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所以平时也没什么可做的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.26,0:51:12.08,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}so there wasn't much to fuckin' do out there
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.08,0:51:14.70,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}只能到处走走看看 以及...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.08,0:51:14.70,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}besides walk around and explore and...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.77,0:51:15.81,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}以及...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.77,0:51:15.81,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.98,0:51:20.56,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}以及仰望星空 编点故事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.98,0:51:20.56,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and look up at the stars and make up stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.26,0:51:22.35,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}比如呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.26,0:51:22.35,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.24,0:51:28.11,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}跟你说吧 马蒂 我每天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.24,0:51:28.11,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I tell you, Marty, I've been up in that room
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.11,0:51:31.56,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}都在房间里看着窗外 想着...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.11,0:51:31.56,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}looking out those windows every night here and just thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.54,0:51:39.81,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这不过就是个故事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.54,0:51:39.81,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It's just one story.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.76,0:51:42.85,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}最老的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.76,0:51:42.85,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}The oldest.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.26,0:51:48.17,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.26,0:51:48.17,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.06,0:51:52.80,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}光明与黑暗之战
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.06,0:51:52.80,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Light versus dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.85,0:52:01.55,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我知道我们不在阿拉斯加 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.85,0:52:01.55,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I know we ain't in Alaska, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.86,0:52:06.98,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}看起来黑暗占了上风
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.86,0:52:06.98,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}appears to me that the dark has a lot more territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.35,0:52:12.29,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.35,0:52:12.29,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.77,0:52:15.12,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.77,0:52:15.12,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You're right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.28,0:52:22.43,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}听着
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.28,0:52:22.43,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Hey, listen, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.43,0:52:23.75,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}怎么?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.43,0:52:23.75,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.06,0:52:27.87,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你为什么不给我指一下汽车的方向?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.06,0:52:27.87,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why don't you point me in the direction of the car, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.46,0:52:30.91,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我这辈子在医院里待得够久的了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.46,0:52:30.91,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I've spent enough of my fuckin' life in hospitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.77,0:52:34.80,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}上帝啊 你知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.77,0:52:34.80,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Jesus. Oh. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.91,0:52:36.58,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我虽然不赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.91,0:52:36.58,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'd protest,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.05,0:52:40.02,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但是看起来你还死不了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.05,0:52:40.02,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but it occurs to me that you're unkillable.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.87,0:52:42.77,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你要回去穿点衣服吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.87,0:52:42.77,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You want to go back, get clothes or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.77,0:52:46.18,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不用了 留在那里的东西都不要了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.77,0:52:46.18,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No, anything I left back there, I don't need.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.11,0:52:56.45,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你知道 关于天空... 你弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.11,0:52:56.45,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You know, you're looking at it wrong, the...sky thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.67,0:52:58.68,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.67,0:52:58.68,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}How is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.88,0:53:02.95,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}以前 这个世界只有黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.88,0:53:02.95,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, once, there was only dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.42,0:53:07.73,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}要我说 是光明占了上风
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.42,0:53:07.73,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}If you ask me, the light's winning.
