Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:17.30,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h从尘土飞扬的远山\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ From the dusty mesa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:21.69,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h升起她若隐若现的影\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ Her looming shadow grows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:25.59,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h涂满毒油的枝杈\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ Hidden in the branches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.09,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h伸展着为她遮掩\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ Of the poison creosote
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:35.59,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h她的脊柱盘旋而上\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ She twines her spines up slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:39.59,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h慢慢靠近正在沸腾的太阳\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ Towards the boiling sun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:43.09,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h当我触摸她的皮肤\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ And when I touched her skin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:48.19,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h指尖喷涌出鲜血\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ My fingers ran with blood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:01:00.99,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h当岩石上残留最后一束光\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ When the last light warms the rocks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:03.39,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h响尾蛇缓缓展开了身躯\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ And the rattlesnakes unfold
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.21,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h山猫也将过来\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ Mountain cats will come
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.30,0:01:11.89,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h拖走你的骨头\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ To drag away your bones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:18.41,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h永远随我升起吧\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ And rise with me forever
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:21.41,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h越过无声的砂砾\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ Across the silent sand
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:24.81,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h星辰将成为你的眼睛\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ And the stars will be your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:29.91,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h风将成为我的双手\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ And the wind will be my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.87,0:53:28.37,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h在一天最昏暗的时刻 我们坦白了自己的无知\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3\fad(500,0)}♪ The emptiness that we confess in the dimmest hour of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.50,0:53:34.00,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h在平凡的小镇里 人们像羔羊一样低沉 悲伤地呻吟\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ In the common town, they make a sound like the low sad moan of prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.42,0:53:39.92,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h那苦涩的滋味 躲藏的脸庞 那个消失的孩子已被遗忘\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ The bitter taste, the hidden face of the lost forgotten child.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.25,0:53:45.25,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h最黑暗的索求 最缓慢的速度 还有那相似的手法\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ The darkest need, the slowest speed, the pattern reconciled.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.57,0:53:51.57,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h在毒害他们的罪恶面前 这些照片是多么苍白\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ These photographs mean nothing to the poison that they take.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.89,0:53:58.89,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h在片刻的荣耀来临之时 光芒已开始消散\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ Before a moment's glory, the light begins to fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.00,0:54:27.00,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h死去的人们在水面上行走 冰冷的血液在他们的身体中流\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3}♪ These dead men walk on water. A cold blood runs through their veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.12,0:54:34.62,SongChs,,0,0,0,,\h\h\h\h愤怒的河水开始上涨 我们也一同步入雨中\N{\rSongEng\fax-0.3\fad(0,500)}♪ The angry river rises. As we step into the rain.
